#: ../../library/kibana.rst:2
msgid "Library Example: Kibana"
msgstr "**Azure Stack**"

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Cloud privé compatible Azure. Sous-ensemble des capacités Azure public."

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:7
msgid ""
"In this example we will build out a new Kibana Library item to automate "
"the installation and configuration of Kibana. This simple example "
"utilizes all sections of the Library including Inputs, File Templates and"
" Scripts."
msgstr "Note"

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:9 ../../library/kibana.rst:20
msgid "Configure Virtual Image"
msgstr "Les clouds marqués « Delivered as external plugin » sont installés séparément de l'appliance |morpheus|. Ils sont disponibles sur le `Morpheus Marketplace <https://share.morpheusdata.com>`_ et peuvent être installés via |AdmIntPlu|."

#: ../../library/kibana.rst:10 ../../library/kibana.rst:29
