#: ../../library/kibana.rst:101
msgid ""
"We will use TYPE type to allow the user to input the version required. "
"Using `Select` is also an option, which would be associated with an "
"OPTION LIST with pre-populated version options defined via a CSV or JSON "
"dataset, or from a REST source query, however to remain flexible and "
"leave all future version options available, we will use TEXT type in this"
" example."
msgstr "Synchronisation des tags"

